{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Sid": "DenyLeaveOrganization",
      "Effect": "Deny",
      "Action": "organizations:LeaveOrganization",
      "Resource": "*"
    }
  ]
}

/*
  WHY THIS SCP EXISTS:
  Any account that successfully calls LeaveOrganization instantly escapes:
  - All SCPs (every governance guardrail disappears immediately)
  - Consolidated billing (cost visibility is lost)
  - Security Hub and AWS Config aggregation
  - Any centralised logging configuration

  In the seconds between leaving and detection, a compromised account
  could perform unrestricted actions with no guardrails.

  This SCP closes that escape hatch. Attach at Root level.
  Even the member account root user cannot leave the organisation.

  The Management Account root user (not subject to SCPs) can still
  remove accounts from the org if genuinely needed — this maintains
  a controlled emergency override.
*/
